  "term": "schizophreniform disorder",
  "definition": "Schizophreniform disorder is a mental disorder marked by schizophrenia-like symptoms, but its total duration is shorter: it lasts at least 1 month and less than 6 months. It also usually causes less disruption in social and work functioning than schizophrenia.",
